      "writtenOn": "2025-09-24T19:11:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yep, this is correct understanding (and it applies to many other cases besides kvm_mmu_zap_all_fast() as well). Or, it might be ok if kvm_mmu_zap_all_fast() is called, as long as it is no-op and as long as it is ok that it does nothing. (I need to take a look if that in the case with the kvm_mmu_invalidate_mmio_sptes() case noticed by Greg.)",
