      "writtenOn": "2025-09-24T10:06:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "kvm_mmu_zap_all_fast is also called with no `kvm_memslot_flush_zap_all` guard from `kvm_mmu_invalidate_mmio_sptes` so this seems to be yet another place from where unmap to pKVM will be missed and seems potentially wrong, right?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7285,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 7285,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "fec8f4f490e5784f9ad6784fbdeb4fcc8545aa86",
